  "bodyHash": "6n9fuNYk4Xc=",
  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/mod/2020/361/13329231_l.webp\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\">𝔹𝕠𝕤𝕤 𝕄𝕦𝕤𝕚𝕔 𝕄𝕠𝕕</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这是一款专注于为玩家在与凋灵和末影龙激烈交锋时添加背景音乐的模组。说实话，主要功能就这些。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>您可以通过游戏内菜单选项&gt;\"音乐与音效\"中的\"唱片机/音符盒\"滑块来调整模组中音乐的音量。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\"><strong>您还可以使用两个不同的命令来切换（开启/关闭）模组的首领主题音乐。</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#936\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#936\"><em><strong>/trigger bmm.wither_theme.toggle </strong></em>切换凋灵首领主题音乐</span></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#936\"><em><strong>/trigger bmm.ender_dragon_theme.toggle </strong></em>切换末影龙首领主题音乐</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><br><span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">音乐曲目</span><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ZdAuyYBVC4\" rel=\"nofollow\">84tangelo - 凋灵（凋灵主题曲）</a></span></p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0ZdAuyYBVC4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GAW5tuC83mE\" rel=\"nofollow\">solunary - 终末将至（末影龙主题曲）</a></span></p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GAW5tuC83mE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如何解决\"出生点播放音乐\"的问题</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可能安装了<strong>动态环绕声</strong>模组。别担心，并不需要完全从模组列表中移除该模组。您可以按照以下步骤解决问题，<strong>同时保留动态环绕声模组</strong>。<em>祝您好运！</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing</a></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
